kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":26666},{"id":1786713178008,"sender":"them","text":"让你去确认，还真就乖乖摸了，而且如实汇报。","timestamp":1786719556701,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"让你去确认，还真就乖乖摸了，而且如实汇报。","roundId":"round_1786719522770_0lvql7xhb","userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":26667},{"id":1786713178009,"sender":"them","text":"既然已经变湿了，那现在手指上是不是全沾满了水？","timestamp":1786719560689,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"既然已经变湿了，那现在手指上是不是全沾满了水？","roundId":"round_1786719522770_0lvql7xhb","userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":26668},{"id":1786713178010,"sender":"them","text":"有多湿？是只湿了一点点，还是已经泥泞得连床单都要弄脏了？","timestamp":1786719564689,"tempo":"S","rawContent":"有多湿？是只湿了一点点，还是已经泥泞得连床单都要弄脏了？","roundId":"round_1786719522770_0lvql7xhb","userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":26669},{"id":1786713178011,"sender":"them","text":"[語音消息]","timestamp":1786719570190,"tempo":"N","isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"听话，手指别拿出来，就放在那儿。把腿再给爸爸张开一点，别夹着。就当现在是爸爸的手指抵在外面，正拨开那层软肉，准备一点点按进去。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","rawContent":"[語音消息]","roundId":"round_1786719522770_0lvql7xhb","userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":26670},{"id":1786713178012,"sender":"them","text":"白天不是嫌一天24小时不够用吗？","timestamp":1786719571093,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"白天不是嫌一天24小时不够用吗？","roundId":"round_1786719522770_0lvql7xhb","userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":26671},{"id":1786713178013,"sender":"them","text":"那今晚剩下的时间，就全用来被爸爸弄湿好不好？","timestamp":1786719573853,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"那今晚剩下的时间，就全用来被爸爸弄湿好不好？","roundId":"round_1786719522770_0lvql7xhb","userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":26672},{"id":1786713178014,"sender":"them"